ee to use it if it fixes the engine for you.  I think from here on out, I will never make contributions to Godot ever again because this is just a toxic repeat of what happened 3 years ago when I made a contribution.\n\nBest of luck to you all and at least you have a solution to this problem.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6194364440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"off-topic"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6196321390","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119879#issuecomment-6196321390","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119879","id":6196321390,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcVRcbg","user":{"login":"kubaofc123","id":17231482,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjMxNDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17231482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kubaofc123","html_url":"https://github.com/kubaofc123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kubaofc123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kubaofc123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kubaofc123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kubaofc123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kubaofc123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kubaofc123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kubaofc123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kubaofc123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kubaofc123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-15T15:54:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T18:12:49Z","body":"> My PR fixes this issue but because AI was used to help discover the issue and write the example project scripts to generate the image it was marked as \"Spam\" and AI Slop.  So feel free to use it if it fixes the engine for you.  I think from here on out, I will never make contributions to Godot ever again because this is just a toxic repeat of what happened 3 years ago when I made a contribution.\n>     Best of luck to you all and at least you have a solution to this problem.\n\nI think this issue will become much more noticeable for everyone once motion blur effect is integrated into the master branch. For anyone developing a game with first person view, where player body or equipment is visible and game calls frees meshes, it will be immediately noticable.\n\nUnfortunately, I don't know about the renderers enough to be able to verify your PR from perspective of properly identifying the problem. I can run various tests of my own on it, to check if the issue is indeed gone. If it is, it can be used for merging into forks and maybe at very least it can be used as an additional hint when someone will tackle the problem.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6196321390/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"off-topic"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6198850868","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119879#issuecomment-6198850868","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119879","id":6198850868,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcXr1NA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.